      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 422,
        "body": {
          "error": "invalid_role"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "_step": "Closing as hired-through-the-platform without naming anybody is refused. This is the one field that closes the loop between a ranked contributor and a job, and an anonymous claim of it measures nothing.",
      "as": "hank",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/org-roles/01920000-0000-7000-8000-00000000b001/roles/{{revision}}/close",
        "body": {
          "reason": "hired_via_platform"
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 422,
        "body": {
          "error": "invalid_role"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "_step": "AND SOMEBODY WHO WAS NEVER ON THIS ROLE IS REFUSED. Alice is a real contributor who was never staged for it, let alone contacted. A company may record hiring somebody who agreed to talk to it and nobody else.",
      "as": "hank",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/org-roles/01920000-0000-7000-8000-00000000b001/roles/{{revision}}/close",
        "body": {
          "reason": "hired_via_platform",
          "note": "",
          "hired": ["01920000-0000-7000-8000-00000000a001"]
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 422,
        "body": {
          "error": "hire_not_accepted"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "_step": "A contributor who does not exist is refused IDENTICALLY. Hires are now picked from the role's own candidate list rather than typed as addresses, so the question 'does this person have an account here?' cannot be asked at all — and the one refusal covers never-staged, never-answered and declined without saying which.",
      "as": "hank",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/org-roles/01920000-0000-7000-8000-00000000b001/roles/{{revision}}/close",
        "body": {
          "reason": "hired_via_platform",
          "note": "",
          "hired": ["01920000-0000-7000-8000-0000000fffff"]
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 422,
        "body": {
          "error": "hire_not_accepted"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "_step": "Closed as hired elsewhere — the honest alternative the refusal offers. Not a consolation answer: a company that keeps filling roles from elsewhere is telling us something specific, and tells us honestly only because that answer is as easy to give as the flattering one.",
      "as": "hank",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/org-roles/01920000-0000-7000-8000-00000000b001/roles/{{revision}}/close",
        "body": {
          "reason": "hired_elsewhere"
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 200,
        "body": {
          "id": "<uuid>",
          "organization_id": "01920000-0000-7000-8000-00000000b001",
          "status": "closed",
          "title": "Staff backend engineer",
          "description": "",
          "engagement": "full_time",
          "location": "remote",
